In both cases the measured suppression is consistent with what would be expected if the medium produced in heavy-ion collisions provides the color screening mechanism of the QGP as proposed by Matsui and Satz. Presently more detailed analyses are making measurements of \(\Upsilon\) suppression for the 3S state and exploring suppression differentially in rapidity and \(p_{T}\) for all states.

